                        "target_lang_word": "appreciably",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "appreciably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8dedaedc-fbb3-3a5b-a8e2-2e9decfca8e9",
                                        "entry_id": "5986be59-8fe9-351e-8f6c-20f1c67adc2f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an appreciable manner; to a large extent; considerably."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1246b16d-e924-4ed1-9280-ab03628181a1",
                                                "sense_id": "8dedaedc-fbb3-3a5b-a8e2-2e9decfca8e9",
                                                "text": "His fervour tempered her resistance appreciably."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b331b03-548e-4bf5-973b-e0de78f77b39",
                                                "sense_id": "8dedaedc-fbb3-3a5b-a8e2-2e9decfca8e9",
                                                "text": "If there are infinite universes, of course there’d be infinite universes where Rick isn’t the smartest person around. But we’ve never seen Rick end up in a place where other people are appreciably smarter than him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b116d34-a1fe-4c71-ae10-c2adc5a265b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a885bb6-64f3-38df-8109-87e98dee7f72",
                        "source_sense_description": "значительно",
                        "target_lang_word": "considerably",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "considerably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b80fe9e0-8d14-3ec9-96f3-1fc0d3235f30",
                                        "entry_id": "444ecb7c-37f7-34ea-9e51-e3cd4dd32b1a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Significantly; to a degree worth considering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9e72450-c056-412e-a4d6-b1f84652e734",
                                                "sense_id": "b80fe9e0-8d14-3ec9-96f3-1fc0d3235f30",
                                                "text": "The situation has improved considerably."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "becde3c9-fb76-44af-a543-bffd1b38aaa2",
                                                "sense_id": "b80fe9e0-8d14-3ec9-96f3-1fc0d3235f30",
                                                "text": "The situation is considerably better."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "affd7d73-ef23-472a-b290-f971d40cd902",
                                                "sense_id": "b80fe9e0-8d14-3ec9-96f3-1fc0d3235f30",
                                                "text": "From several magnets combined von Hellenbach and Gessmann in Vienna constructed considerably stronger hypnoscopes, through which 66 per cent. of those examined showed the above mentioned sensitiveness […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04748506-8136-41be-b27b-35ce5d42461a",
                                                "sense_id": "b80fe9e0-8d14-3ec9-96f3-1fc0d3235f30",
                                                "text": "The hand which is not concealed by the drapery is gloveless; the arms are bare considerably above the elbow; and a bracelet encircles the right wrist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c60277b-93fd-4ba5-bdff-d305b538a0d6",
                                                "sense_id": "b80fe9e0-8d14-3ec9-96f3-1fc0d3235f30",
                                                "text": "Despite the ups and downs of removals and rehousings, the collection was considerably extended under his guidance, both by purchases and donations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03016583-8b53-4e64-90fa-92906e779f9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a885bb6-64f3-38df-8109-87e98dee7f72",
